# Medivise configuration — where each variable lives. Details: DEPLOYMENT.md.
#
# 1) This file -> copy to .env (repo root, git-ignored). Read by `npm run dev:api`, the local
#    stand-in for the Vercel /api functions (the AI assistant).
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-opus-5-5
# ANTHROPIC_EFFORT=medium              # low | medium | high | xhigh | max
# CONVEX_URL is read from .env.local, which `npx convex dev` writes.
#
# 2) Vercel -> Project -> Settings -> Environment Variables (then redeploy):
#      VITE_CONVEX_URL     production Convex URL (web app build + /api runtime)
#      ANTHROPIC_API_KEY   activates the AI assistant (server-side only)
#      ANTHROPIC_MODEL, ANTHROPIC_EFFORT   optional, as above
#      CONVEX_DEPLOY_KEY   optional: deploy convex/ on every Vercel build
#
# 3) Convex deployment variables (not a file; `npx convex env set NAME value`, add --prod for production):
#      JWT_PRIVATE_KEY, JWKS, SITE_URL   set by `npx @convex-dev/auth` (required for sign-in)
#      AUTH_RESEND_KEY, AUTH_EMAIL_FROM  optional: password-reset codes by email (Resend)
#      ML_SERVICE_URL                    optional: Python inference service in ml/
#
# 4) Frontend dev server: frontend/.env (copy frontend/.env.example) -> VITE_CONVEX_URL
